22449      datalines;

NOTE: The data set WORK.ICECREAM has 15 observations and 3 variables.

22465      ;
22466      proc genmod data=Icecream rorder=data;
22467      freq count;
22468      class brand;
22469      model taste = brand / dist=multinomial
22470      link=cumlogit
22471      aggregate=brand
22472      type1;
22473      estimate 'LogOR12' brand 1 -1 / exp;
22474      estimate 'LogOR13' brand 1 0 -1 / exp;
22475      estimate 'LogOR23' brand 0 1 -1 / exp;
22476      run;

NOTE: PROC GENMOD is modeling the probabilities of levels of taste having LOWER Ordered Values in the response profile table.
NOTE: Algorithm converged.
NOTE: The scale parameter was held fixed.
